window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Sometimes you spend your life looking for something and find out it's been right in front of you the whole damn time.\" </p> <p>The premature death of his dad and a tumultuous childhood has left coal miner Tommy 'Huck\" Sawyer hardened to emotion and relationships. Andi Sullivan is the one woman who can break through that tough exterior. But Andi, the twin sister of Tommy's best friend, is destined for better things, away from her harsh father's control and their sooty mining town. It seems everything is against Tommy ever having the one thing his heart wants most. </p> <p>Andi Sullivan has achieved her life's goal of a successful nursing career in the city, away from her hometown. She's even started dating a doctor. Everything is perfect and dreamy, almost. Something, or someone, is pulling at her heartstrings, pulling her back to Bluefield, the place she was so anxious to leave. When an accident pushes Tommy Sawyer, her troubled childhood friend, back into her life, Andi soon finds herself torn between two worlds and two happy endings. </p>"; 
